        Args:
            input (Tensor): the input tensor.

        Keyword args:
            out (Tensor, optional): the output tensor.

        Example::

            >>> tensorplay.conj_physical(tensorplay.tensor([-1 + 1j, -2 + 2j, 3 - 3j]))
            tensor([-1 - 1j, -2 - 2j, 3 + 3j])
