        Example::

            >>> input = tensorplay.tensor([-1.5, 0, 2.0])
            >>> values = tensorplay.tensor([0.5])
            >>> tensorplay.heaviside(input, values)
            tensor([0.0000, 0.5000, 1.0000])
            >>> values = tensorplay.tensor([1.2, -2.0, 3.5])
            >>> tensorplay.heaviside(input, values)
            tensor([0., -2., 1.])
        """

