        Closeness is defined as:

        .. math::
            \lvert \text{input}_i - \text{other}_i \rvert \leq \texttt{rtol} \times \lvert \text{other}_i \rvert + \texttt{atol}


        where :attr:`input` and :attr:`other` are finite. Where :attr:`input`
