        Examples::

            >>> tensorplay.isclose(tensorplay.tensor((1., 2, 3)), tensorplay.tensor((1 + 1e-10, 3, 4)))
            tensor([ True, False, False])
            >>> tensorplay.isclose(tensorplay.tensor((float('inf'), 4)), tensorplay.tensor((float('inf'), 6)), rtol=.5)
            tensor([True, True])
        """

